  "description": "The Peraton Notification UiPath Custom Activity package is a core sets of operations (methods) for sending Email, SMS, WhatsApp messages, Voice Call and Verification code, using Amazon Pinpoint, Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS), Amazon Simple Email Service (SES), SendGrid, and Twilio service’s resources. It consists of 21 activities that are grouped in 3 core service integration components: AWS, SendGrid and Twilio.",
